<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-008" chapter-id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return" source-id="s-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return">
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:dai" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">乙酉，輔國將軍、河南太守<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:dai:m0012" ref="cf7_e15_166">戴施</persName>奔于宛。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:may" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">五月丁巳，遣北中郎將<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:may:m0010" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_DA">庾希</persName>、竟陵太守<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:may:m0017" ref="okp_6uz_rfi">鄧遐</persName>以舟師救洛陽。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:appointments" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">五月，加征西大將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:appointments:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>侍中、大司馬、都督中外諸軍事、錄尚書事、假黃鉞。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:regency" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:regency:m0000" ref="emb_vx4_gm9">帝</persName>雅好黃老，斷穀，餌長生藥，服食過多，遂中毒，不識萬機，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:regency:m0028" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAB">崇德太后</persName>復臨朝攝政。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:capital" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:capital:m0001" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲揚州牧、錄尚書事。壬申，遣使喻<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:capital:m0019" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>入相，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:capital:m0023" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>不從。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">九月，冠軍將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen:m0007" ref="so1_bi5_jha">陳祐</persName>留長史<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:chen:m0012" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_A">沈勁</persName>守洛陽，帥衆奔新城。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丙申，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-return:death:m0003" ref="emb_vx4_gm9">帝</persName>崩于西堂，時年二十五。</p>
</text>
